{"task_id": "Mbpp/410", "solution": "def min_val(input_list):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the minimum numeric value in a given heterogeneous list.\n    Non-numeric elements are ignored; if no numeric elements are found, a ValueError is raised.\n    \"\"\"\n    numeric_elements = []\n    for item in input_list:\n        if isinstance(item, (int, float)):\n            numeric_elements.append(item)\n\n    if not numeric_elements:\n        raise ValueError('no numeric elements in input list')\n\n    return min(numeric_elements)"}
