{"task_id": "Mbpp/566", "solution": "def _digits_of(n: int) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"Extracts the decimal digits of a non-negative integer into a list.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return [0]\n    return [int(char_digit) for char_digit in str(n)]\ndef sum_digits(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of the digits of a non-negative integer.\"\"\"\n    digits = _digits_of(n)\n    return sum(digits)"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/567", "solution": "def issort_list(input_list) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if a list is sorted in non-decreasing (ascending) order.\n    Returns True for empty or single-element lists.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(input_list)\n    if n <= 1:\n        return True\n    \n    for i in range(n - 1):\n        if input_list[i] > input_list[i+1]:\n            return False\n            \n    return True"}
